    {
      "text": "本体组件是 RepeatedlyDamageEnemiesWithinRadius：每周期基础冷伤 + addedDamageScaling × 附加法术伤害，hit=false、damageAtStart=true；周期与基础寿命来自能力数据。数值不在此抄写，读 ruleset 组件字段。",
      "source": "$.applicability.notes"
    },
    {
      "text": "compute_body：按 Red Giant/Binary 生成分量 → added×scaling + 基础值 → inc/more/target → 每跳伤害；表达式树写入 result.single_cast.body.components[].expression。",
      "source": "$.handler_ref.note（le_calc.damage.compute_body）"
